# Characteristics

✔ Stores data as Key-Value pairs

✔ Uses hashing

✔ Keys are unique

✔ Values can be duplicated

✔ Thread-safe

✔ Every public method is synchronized

✔ No insertion order

✔ No sorting

❌ Does NOT allow null key

❌ Does NOT allow null value

✔ Legacy class

