# Constructors

### 1. Default Constructor

```java
Hashtable<Integer,String> table =
        new Hashtable<>();
```

Default

```text
Capacity = 11

Load Factor = 0.75
```

---

### 2. Initial Capacity

```java
Hashtable<Integer,String> table =
        new Hashtable<>(20);
```

---

### 3. Capacity + Load Factor

```java
Hashtable<Integer,String> table =
        new Hashtable<>(20,0.75f);
```

---

### 4. Copy Constructor

```java
Hashtable<Integer,String> table =
        new Hashtable<>(anotherMap);
```

