# Advantages

✔ Thread-safe

✔ Fast lookup

✔ No duplicate keys

✔ Good for legacy code

---

# Disadvantages

❌ Slower than `HashMap` due to synchronization

❌ No null key

❌ No null values

❌ Legacy class

❌ `ConcurrentHashMap` is preferred for modern concurrent applications

